WEBVTT

01:31.424 --> 01:32.240
=Blossoms of Power=

01:32.256 --> 01:35.140
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

01:35.220 --> 01:38.180
=Episode 14=

01:38.300 --> 01:41.060
(Gudu Garden)

01:42.120 --> 01:42.560
Here.

01:42.560 --> 01:44.480
- Kick it to me.
- Brother, I want to play too.

01:45.648 --> 01:46.510
Thank you, Brother.

01:46.510 --> 01:48.000
Let me play!

01:49.430 --> 01:50.230
Nanny Liu.

01:52.040 --> 01:52.870
Nanny Liu,

01:53.200 --> 01:54.590
why is there bloody water?

01:55.790 --> 01:57.280
What a tragedy.

01:57.280 --> 01:59.040
One of the children is badly injured.

01:59.040 --> 02:00.200
Nanny, don't panic.

02:00.200 --> 02:01.568
I'll go take a look right now.

02:07.590 --> 02:09.910
You must be
Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.400
How did you get hurt so badly?

02:13.800 --> 02:15.080
I am Qi Pei.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.910
From Li County, Shunan.

02:16.910 --> 02:19.150
My older brother owed gambling debts,

02:19.150 --> 02:21.150
and was thrown into prison
in Zenan District.

02:21.560 --> 02:23.080
But he never gambles.

02:25.240 --> 02:26.360
When I went to visit him,

02:26.910 --> 02:28.590
he had vanished into thin air.

02:28.840 --> 02:30.360
I sought help everywhere to no avail,

02:30.384 --> 02:32.656
so I had to come to the capital
to appeal to the Emperor.

02:33.120 --> 02:35.190
As a result, I was hunted down
all the way here.

02:35.328 --> 02:36.400
Do you have any evidence?

02:36.448 --> 02:38.192
The officials in Zenan
protect each other,

02:38.406 --> 02:39.526
and distort the truth.

02:39.870 --> 02:41.120
The evidence I collected

02:41.360 --> 02:43.240
was tricked out of me and destroyed.

02:51.470 --> 02:53.120
They must have caught up with me.

02:53.120 --> 02:54.630
Mo Yu, protect Qi Pei.

02:54.630 --> 02:55.560
We'll go out together.

02:56.000 --> 02:56.470
Yes.

03:15.808 --> 03:17.080
There's tung oil in the water.

03:17.800 --> 03:19.470
These deranged thugs

03:19.470 --> 03:20.800
dare to commit crimes so openly!

03:34.710 --> 03:35.190
Hurry.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.950
Mo Yu, stay close to me!

04:25.950 --> 04:26.430
Yes.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.360
Come.

04:48.288 --> 04:50.310
- Protect His Highness!
- Protect His Highness!

04:50.310 --> 04:51.240
- The guards are here! Retreat!
- Hurry!

04:51.480 --> 04:52.630
- Hurry!
- Hurry!

04:52.630 --> 04:54.630
- Protect His Highness!
- Protect His Highness!

04:56.192 --> 04:57.600
Imperial Guards, hear my command!

04:57.680 --> 05:00.390
There are assassins
in the courtyard. Arrest them all.

05:00.400 --> 05:01.630
Don't let a single one escape.

05:02.240 --> 05:02.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:03.120 --> 05:03.600
Go!

05:09.888 --> 05:10.720
Commandery Princess!

05:10.928 --> 05:11.800
Commandery Princess!

05:13.720 --> 05:15.240
Qi Pei is a crucial witness.

05:15.800 --> 05:16.830
Keep him safe.

05:17.390 --> 05:18.000
Don't worry.

05:18.048 --> 05:19.160
Everything will be fine.

05:21.984 --> 05:22.830
Commandery Princess!

05:23.472 --> 05:24.310
Commandery Princess!

05:34.590 --> 05:35.160
Your Highness,

05:35.170 --> 05:36.800
Commandery Princess went
to Gudu Garden to care for the orphans,

05:36.800 --> 05:37.680
and encountered a fire.

05:39.680 --> 05:40.830
Where is she now?

05:40.830 --> 05:41.630
How is she doing?

05:41.830 --> 05:42.720
She was rescued.

05:42.720 --> 05:43.792
She is not seriously hurt.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.040
Who saved her?

05:45.104 --> 05:46.288
I will reward them handsomely.

05:47.480 --> 05:48.560
It was Prince Lie.

06:04.000 --> 06:04.992
Drink your medicine.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.000
The Duke's manor is heavily guarded,

06:14.000 --> 06:15.510
yet you can come and go as you please.

06:15.712 --> 06:17.560
It seems you are not only
in good health,

06:17.648 --> 06:19.190
but also highly skilled in martial arts.

06:27.310 --> 06:29.240
We are destined
to be husband and wife after all.

06:30.600 --> 06:32.640
Naturally, I have no need
to hide anything from you.

06:33.536 --> 06:34.512
Drink your medicine.

06:41.360 --> 06:43.560
Are you forcing me
to feed it to you with my lips?

06:45.830 --> 06:47.430
I never yield to threats.

07:16.240 --> 07:17.680
I have been very restrained.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.310
I don't want to offend you,

07:24.070 --> 07:25.600
nor do I want you to despise me.

07:25.750 --> 07:26.870
Xiao Huayong.

07:31.408 --> 07:34.120
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,
who always prioritizes the big picture,

07:34.830 --> 07:36.070
abandoned me

07:37.430 --> 07:38.750
to choose another.

07:41.070 --> 07:42.270
But who else

07:43.750 --> 07:45.160
is a better match for you than me,

07:48.390 --> 07:49.870
who has a legitimate imperial descent

07:50.680 --> 07:51.870
and a short life expectancy?

08:17.120 --> 08:18.390
Legitimate imperial descent

08:19.000 --> 08:19.800
can be changed.

08:22.560 --> 08:23.870
Whether your life is short or not

08:24.430 --> 08:25.360
can be orchestrated.

08:50.080 --> 08:50.790
Get out.

09:14.736 --> 09:16.336
Don't be angry, Commandery Princess.

09:17.270 --> 09:18.390
It's my fault.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.270
Get some good rest.

09:22.200 --> 09:23.960
I'll handle the rest.

09:25.030 --> 09:25.910
As for Changying,

09:27.320 --> 09:29.550
you don't need to thank him in person.

09:40.720 --> 09:41.390
Your Highness,

09:41.504 --> 09:44.112
aren't you just making the
Commandery Princess angry for nothing?

09:47.030 --> 09:48.320
When I heard she was in danger,

09:48.750 --> 09:49.840
I was worried sick.

09:50.630 --> 09:51.630
And I blamed myself,

09:52.240 --> 09:53.750
wishing I had been the one to save her.

09:57.200 --> 09:58.670
I felt so powerless and anxious

10:00.270 --> 10:01.840
that I lost my composure for a moment.

10:03.510 --> 10:04.480
In all these years,

10:05.320 --> 10:06.670
you've never been like this.

10:11.664 --> 10:12.910
Are we returning to the palace?

10:19.030 --> 10:19.870
No.

10:23.360 --> 10:24.600
We're going to deliver a gift.

10:28.300 --> 10:30.240
I happened to see her going
to Gudu Garden today,

10:30.630 --> 10:32.000
so I quietly followed her.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.960
At least I could be
a little closer to her.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.550
I didn't expect to save her.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.600
Changying,

10:49.910 --> 10:51.910
knowing the road ahead is doomed,

10:52.960 --> 10:54.600
yet still embracing it willingly...

10:54.976 --> 10:56.200
I understand that feeling, too.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.670
I won't try to persuade you anymore.

11:06.320 --> 11:07.270
I couldn't anyway.

11:10.390 --> 11:11.150
Changqing...

11:11.270 --> 11:11.840
Your Highness,

11:12.360 --> 11:13.390
the Crown Prince is here.

11:36.030 --> 11:37.390
Greetings, Your Highness.

11:38.200 --> 11:39.200
Greetings, Your Highness.

11:39.200 --> 11:40.240
We are brothers.

11:41.744 --> 11:42.864
No need for formalities.

11:48.460 --> 11:50.700
Your Highness, to what do we owe
the honor of your visit?

11:50.720 --> 11:51.970
Do you have any orders for us?

11:53.440 --> 11:55.510
I just came from Duke of Wei's Manor.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.910
The Commandery Princess asked me

11:57.910 --> 12:00.150
to thank you on her behalf
for saving her, Changying.

12:11.240 --> 12:13.200
This is between
the Commandery Princess and me.

12:15.030 --> 12:17.080
You did her a great favor.

12:17.088 --> 12:18.890
But men and women
should keep their distance.

12:18.960 --> 12:20.720
She wishes to avoid suspicion,

12:21.200 --> 12:22.270
which is why she asked me

12:22.720 --> 12:23.840
to thank you on her behalf.

12:28.600 --> 12:30.150
Since the gift has been delivered...

12:33.150 --> 12:33.790
There's no rush.

12:35.296 --> 12:37.456
This is Commandery Princess's gift
of gratitude.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.150
My gift of gratitude

12:39.720 --> 12:40.910
hasn't been delivered yet.

12:57.020 --> 12:58.780
(Minister Song...)

12:59.960 --> 13:03.120
This letter seems to be a secret missive
from Noble Consort Rong

13:03.120 --> 13:05.510
to win over court officials.

13:07.480 --> 13:10.240
Noble Consort Rong
is working so tirelessly

13:10.240 --> 13:12.030
to gather trusted followers
for you, Changying.

13:12.030 --> 13:14.120
What a deep bond between mother and son.

13:15.888 --> 13:17.510
But I fear it might carry the suspicion

13:18.000 --> 13:20.240
of forming factions for personal gain.

13:23.008 --> 13:25.072
Your Highness,
you're incredibly resourceful,

13:25.270 --> 13:27.550
but these letters are just
about trivial family matters.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.550
They hardly count as forming factions.

13:29.616 --> 13:31.670
And Changying knows absolutely nothing
about them.

13:32.240 --> 13:32.910
Is that so?

13:33.696 --> 13:36.390
But I have dozens
of such letters in my palace.

13:42.240 --> 13:43.270
I naturally believe

13:44.120 --> 13:45.320
what you say, Changqing.

13:46.320 --> 13:47.390
But will others

13:48.120 --> 13:48.870
believe it?

13:54.600 --> 13:56.440
As for this gift from you,

13:57.720 --> 13:59.240
Changying and I are deeply grateful.

14:01.030 --> 14:01.910
We accept it.

14:03.200 --> 14:03.870
Changqing.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.910
Whatever you two brothers intend to do,

14:20.910 --> 14:21.960
I won't interfere.

14:22.840 --> 14:23.960
But as for my woman,

14:28.000 --> 14:30.750
no one is allowed
to lay a finger on her.

14:34.840 --> 14:36.270
Farewell, Your Highness.

14:42.200 --> 14:43.550
Didn't I say it?

14:43.630 --> 14:44.840
We are brothers.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.440
No need for formalities.

14:55.240 --> 14:55.960
Changqing,

14:56.600 --> 14:58.200
these letters can't convict us.

14:58.440 --> 14:59.600
Why let him threaten us?

15:00.600 --> 15:03.320
The Crown Prince
usually just holds back.

15:03.670 --> 15:04.750
Even without these letters,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.200
he would have other ways

15:07.200 --> 15:08.440
to make you back down.

15:08.720 --> 15:10.600
You just have to steer clear
of him for now.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.080
However...

15:14.120 --> 15:14.870
However what?

15:15.750 --> 15:17.360
He came in such a hurry today

15:18.670 --> 15:20.390
and even used letters to threaten us.

15:20.870 --> 15:22.750
This shows that his marriage
with Zhaoning

15:22.870 --> 15:23.790
has hit a snag.

15:24.480 --> 15:26.440
Otherwise,
why would he go to such lengths?

15:30.960 --> 15:33.030
So he hasn't won
Zhaoning's heart either.

15:33.720 --> 15:36.030
The omnipotent Crown Prince

15:38.208 --> 15:40.128
is also just suffering
from unrequited love.

15:45.270 --> 15:45.910
Young Master,

15:46.272 --> 15:48.030
the witness sent
by the Commandery Princess

15:48.030 --> 15:48.870
has been settled in.

15:49.408 --> 15:50.790
Make sure he is well taken care of.

15:50.960 --> 15:52.120
There must be no mistakes.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.200
Rest assured, Young Master.

15:53.712 --> 15:55.390
Li County is under
Shunan's jurisdiction.

15:55.470 --> 15:56.672
I absolutely refuse to believe

15:56.680 --> 15:57.990
that under my father's governance,

15:58.010 --> 15:59.900
such a despicable crime
could happen in Shunan.

15:59.910 --> 16:01.200
Yes, I don't believe it either.

16:01.870 --> 16:02.480
But

16:02.670 --> 16:04.670
why are you packing your bags?

16:05.040 --> 16:07.390
I'm going back
to thoroughly investigate this matter.

16:07.456 --> 16:08.360
You're investigating?

16:08.432 --> 16:10.080
Isn't the imperial court
sending someone?

16:10.150 --> 16:11.240
Within the imperial court,

16:11.320 --> 16:13.600
there are many
who covet Shunan's military power.

16:13.620 --> 16:15.950
I know this better than anyone
from my years in the capital.

16:15.960 --> 16:17.270
This case is murky.

16:17.280 --> 16:18.576
If someone uses it as a pretext,

16:18.576 --> 16:20.910
manipulating the case behind the scenes
to target my father,

16:20.910 --> 16:22.440
by the time the court finishes
investigating and makes a final ruling,

16:22.450 --> 16:24.540
it will be too late.
I must find out the truth first.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.360
Young Master,

16:25.600 --> 16:26.630
I'll go with you.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.270
No need.

16:27.360 --> 16:28.656
I'll go alone and return quickly.

16:28.672 --> 16:30.360
Stay at the manor and cover for me.

16:30.416 --> 16:31.480
And protect the witness.

16:33.960 --> 16:34.670
Young Master,

16:34.840 --> 16:35.910
please be careful.

16:40.080 --> 16:41.568
Vice Minister of Imperial Observatory,

16:41.568 --> 16:42.480
(Receiving the Mandate
and Establishing the Foundation)

16:42.480 --> 16:46.080
I ordered you to choose
an auspicious day for the royal wedding.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.360
Do you have a result?

16:47.960 --> 16:49.200
Replying to Your Majesty,

16:49.200 --> 16:52.270
based on astrology and birth charts,

16:52.390 --> 16:55.270
I have selected a highly auspicious date
for the marriage.

16:55.550 --> 16:57.550
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.070
Excellent.

17:05.790 --> 17:06.590
Huayong,

17:07.030 --> 17:07.830
Zhaoning,

17:08.480 --> 17:09.590
one month from now.

17:09.680 --> 17:12.440
This date is indeed an excellent choice.

17:12.790 --> 17:14.880
What do the two of you think?

17:15.640 --> 17:16.350
Your Majesty,

17:17.510 --> 17:18.920
a few days ago, I

17:18.920 --> 17:20.640
was frightened at Gudu Garden.

17:21.000 --> 17:23.160
I beseech Your Majesty
to postpone the wedding for me.

17:23.392 --> 17:25.070
Regarding the incident at Gudu Garden,

17:25.070 --> 17:26.350
as to who set the fire,

17:26.350 --> 17:28.980
Prefect of Jingzhao has already
ordered a thorough investigation.

17:29.070 --> 17:31.720
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,
you need not worry.

17:32.030 --> 17:32.680
Your Majesty,

17:33.030 --> 17:34.680
I am feeling extremely unwell.

17:34.800 --> 17:37.290
I have already asked the imperial
physician to help me recover.

17:37.720 --> 17:40.030
I truly cannot get married right now.

17:44.160 --> 17:46.110
Your Majesty, since that is the case,

17:46.120 --> 17:48.270
let's wait until
the Commandery Princess feels better.

17:48.336 --> 17:50.976
Marriage is a major event.
There is no need to rush it right now.

17:51.776 --> 17:54.240
Thank you for your understanding,
Your Highness.

17:55.510 --> 17:56.400
Very well.

17:57.240 --> 18:00.070
I respect your wishes.

18:00.440 --> 18:02.680
Once Commandery Princess Zhaoning
has recovered,

18:03.440 --> 18:04.480
Minister of Rites,

18:04.784 --> 18:06.320
Vice Minister of Imperial Observatory,

18:06.720 --> 18:08.880
choose another auspicious date.

18:09.264 --> 18:10.960
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

18:11.060 --> 18:12.070
Thank you, Your Majesty.

18:18.220 --> 18:22.660
(Ningze Prefecture, Zenan District)

18:22.680 --> 18:23.310
Officers,

18:23.488 --> 18:24.700
the vegetables are quite fresh.

18:24.710 --> 18:25.720
I picked them this morning.

18:25.720 --> 18:28.190
Wash them and deliver them
to the magistrate's office for us.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.680
You're new here, huh?

18:40.910 --> 18:42.944
Who told you
that you could set up a stall here?

18:43.680 --> 18:45.590
Officers, please have mercy.

18:45.664 --> 18:48.030
This is my only way
to make a living and feed my family.

18:48.030 --> 18:48.830
Cut the crap.

18:48.920 --> 18:49.550
Get out of here.

18:51.480 --> 18:51.880
You...

18:52.110 --> 18:53.136
What gives you the right?

18:53.152 --> 18:55.310
Why kick my things and chase me away?

18:55.328 --> 18:57.310
I have no one to rely on,
and my life is worthless.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.590
You won't let me do my only job!

18:58.590 --> 18:59.400
How will I survive?

18:59.400 --> 19:00.480
Arrest this unruly peasant!

19:00.496 --> 19:01.248
Hold on!

19:03.720 --> 19:05.590
In broad daylight,

19:07.070 --> 19:08.510
even if these vendors are at fault,

19:08.960 --> 19:10.480
as officers of the imperial court,

19:10.520 --> 19:12.704
how can you abuse your power
to bully people like this?

19:12.720 --> 19:15.430
Who are you? You dare meddle in
the affairs of the magistrate's office?

19:15.440 --> 19:16.750
I am but a humble scholar.

19:17.440 --> 19:19.240
Though I am an outsider
residing in Zenan,

19:19.290 --> 19:20.990
I absolutely cannot stand by
and watch you

19:21.070 --> 19:22.400
bully the commoners like this.

19:23.030 --> 19:24.720
There are so many troublemakers today.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.070
Take them all back.

19:26.144 --> 19:27.590
- Let's see if you're still this cocky
- How can you arrest people?

19:27.590 --> 19:29.200
when we get to the magistrate's office.

19:29.880 --> 19:30.750
What are you doing?

19:31.240 --> 19:32.070
I'm here to help you.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.110
Who asked for your help?

19:33.960 --> 19:34.720
Let go.

19:34.960 --> 19:35.400
Move.

19:37.030 --> 19:37.480
Hurry up.

19:37.920 --> 19:38.400
Faster.

19:41.110 --> 19:42.064
What are you looking at?

19:42.310 --> 19:43.070
Walk faster.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.440
Why were you

19:50.790 --> 19:52.550
causing trouble on the street

19:52.672 --> 19:54.112
and obstructing official duties?

19:54.310 --> 19:54.960
Officer,

19:55.350 --> 19:57.590
I ran out of travel money,
so I set up a stall to get by.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.000
I was just acting on impulse earlier

19:59.000 --> 20:00.160
and offended you officers.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.160
I admit I was wrong, okay?

20:01.160 --> 20:02.510
Don't play dumb with me.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.240
Speak.

20:04.070 --> 20:04.864
What's your name?

20:05.240 --> 20:06.030
Cui Ergou.

20:07.240 --> 20:08.110
Cui Ergou.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.070
And you?

20:10.760 --> 20:12.624
Lin Tieniu.
I am traveling here for my studies.

20:12.630 --> 20:14.352
I was overcome
with righteous indignation.

20:14.368 --> 20:16.820
That's why I spoke up to help.
I didn't mean to cause trouble.

20:16.830 --> 20:18.720
How many people are in your families?

20:18.790 --> 20:20.200
I'm the only one in my family.

20:20.960 --> 20:21.920
Back home,

20:21.920 --> 20:23.400
I have a bedridden elderly father.

20:23.830 --> 20:25.960
Do you have any relatives

20:25.960 --> 20:27.200
working in the government?

20:27.200 --> 20:28.000
- No.
- No.

20:28.350 --> 20:29.310
Anyone in the military?

20:29.310 --> 20:30.030
- No.
- No.

20:35.480 --> 20:36.200
You two

20:36.880 --> 20:38.240
blocked the road with your stall

20:38.350 --> 20:39.568
and obstructed official duties.

20:40.640 --> 20:41.750
It's not a major crime.

20:42.110 --> 20:43.400
We'll lock you up for three days

20:43.790 --> 20:44.750
as a warning to others.

21:20.070 --> 21:22.270
Cui Jinbai, I'm begging you.

21:22.480 --> 21:25.552
I admit I really shouldn't have pestered
you just to avoid the princess.

21:25.560 --> 21:27.110
You have your future,
your reputation.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.000
Don't want any of that anymore?

21:28.000 --> 21:29.160
Could you stop pestering me?

21:34.160 --> 21:35.480
Is this all you have to say to me?

21:35.590 --> 21:36.160
Yes.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.510
Then could I trouble you

21:37.510 --> 21:39.056
to actually listen to what I'm saying?

21:42.368 --> 21:43.960
I have read extensively since childhood.

21:44.288 --> 21:47.270
My family's teachings, the Four Bonds,
the Three Principles and Five Virtues

21:47.270 --> 21:48.880
have long been etched into my bones.

21:49.680 --> 21:50.680
I also resent myself.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.920
Why have I become so absurd
and ridiculous?

21:55.000 --> 21:56.720
I've tried to cut all ties with you.

21:57.310 --> 21:58.310
But I can't do it.

21:58.550 --> 21:59.830
Are you crazy?

21:59.830 --> 22:00.720
I am crazy.

22:05.552 --> 22:07.270
You're the one who made me lose my mind.

22:09.960 --> 22:10.830
To be reckless

22:12.350 --> 22:13.400
and willingly so.

22:27.184 --> 22:28.880
Why don't we take care
of business first?

22:29.100 --> 22:31.290
Let's investigate
this so-called wrongful imprisonment.

22:34.720 --> 22:36.070
If you were coming over to help me,

22:36.070 --> 22:37.712
why didn't you bring a few more people?

22:41.420 --> 22:42.656
Without His Majesty's decree,

22:42.680 --> 22:44.540
or official documents
from the imperial court,

22:44.550 --> 22:46.760
leaving the capital secretly
is already a serious crime.

22:47.136 --> 22:48.960
If I brought people here
and made a big scene,

22:49.536 --> 22:51.248
would I be helping you or harming you?

22:59.790 --> 23:00.720
You two,

23:01.160 --> 23:03.030
we're short on cells right now.

23:03.720 --> 23:05.480
You didn't commit any major offenses.

23:06.000 --> 23:07.440
So we're releasing you early.

23:07.520 --> 23:08.680
You can leave tomorrow night.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.550
Tomorrow night? Why so soon?

23:10.680 --> 23:12.880
What? You want to celebrate
the Chinese New Year here?

23:17.400 --> 23:19.350
Why would they let us go so easily?

23:20.200 --> 23:21.000
Could it be

23:21.350 --> 23:22.680
they have an ulterior motive?

23:30.960 --> 23:33.240
Just sign and fingerprint this,
and you can go.

23:37.980 --> 23:40.620
(Prisoners: Lin Tieniu, Cui Ergou)
(Guard on Duty: Zhao Wu)

23:57.110 --> 23:58.350
Hurry up down there.

23:58.352 --> 23:59.568
- Make it quick.
- Hurry up.

24:01.312 --> 24:02.550
You guys in the back, hurry up.

24:03.640 --> 24:04.880
Move it!

24:09.936 --> 24:10.960
Put some back into it!

24:11.440 --> 24:12.000
Hurry up!

24:18.240 --> 24:18.920
Hurry up!

24:20.750 --> 24:21.200
Move!

24:22.310 --> 24:22.960
Go, go, go!

24:23.168 --> 24:24.640
Move it! What are you looking at?

24:24.640 --> 24:25.030
Hurry up!

24:25.960 --> 24:26.510
Keep moving!

24:26.880 --> 24:27.350
Hurry up!

24:28.000 --> 24:29.030
You in the back, hurry up!

24:29.424 --> 24:30.550
Let me tell you something.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.510
You'd better behave.

24:35.550 --> 24:36.240
Hurry up!

24:38.590 --> 24:39.400
Hurry up!

24:40.070 --> 24:41.000
Stop dawdling!

24:45.680 --> 24:47.920
Hurry up, you guys in the back!

24:48.790 --> 24:50.000
Stop slacking off! Hurry up!

24:53.960 --> 24:54.590
I wouldn't dare!

24:55.200 --> 24:56.830
I'll never do it again!

24:57.070 --> 24:58.830
I'll never do it again!

25:04.480 --> 25:05.270
See that?

25:05.872 --> 25:07.680
That's what happens
when you try to escape.

25:08.440 --> 25:09.590
You'd better work hard.

25:10.110 --> 25:11.640
If anyone dares to run away,

25:12.310 --> 25:13.510
you'll be in for it.

25:14.480 --> 25:14.880
Move!

25:19.030 --> 25:20.640
You guys, over here.

25:20.920 --> 25:21.790
Grab your tools here.

25:22.880 --> 25:23.830
Hurry up!

25:24.310 --> 25:24.830
Hurry up!

25:27.790 --> 25:28.680
Hurry up!

25:30.240 --> 25:30.790
Mister...

25:32.250 --> 25:33.030
Where are you from?

25:33.030 --> 25:33.480
Mister,

25:33.880 --> 25:34.880
how did you end up here?

25:41.920 --> 25:43.880
Looks like we won't
get anything out of them.

25:44.640 --> 25:46.200
Don't worry. We'll find another chance.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.000
You there.

25:49.160 --> 25:49.680
You.

25:49.830 --> 25:50.480
Yes, you.

25:50.680 --> 25:51.510
Take off your shirt.

25:51.690 --> 25:52.480
Come work the forge.

25:56.680 --> 25:57.240
Sir,

25:57.680 --> 25:58.350
let me do it.

26:02.960 --> 26:05.200
First time I've seen someone
volunteer for this.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.736
My family used to run a blacksmith shop.

26:06.740 --> 26:08.340
I've been forging iron
since I was a kid.

26:08.350 --> 26:09.720
I'm not used to mining anyway.

26:11.110 --> 26:12.400
Alright, you're up.

26:13.400 --> 26:14.240
Take off your shirt.

26:14.480 --> 26:15.270
Get to the forge.

26:21.640 --> 26:22.240
Hurry up!

26:30.350 --> 26:31.270
Hurry up!

26:31.440 --> 26:32.240
Stop dawdling!

26:32.350 --> 26:33.160
Get to work!

26:35.110 --> 26:35.920
Hurry up!

26:36.000 --> 26:37.070
Put your back into it!

26:38.240 --> 26:38.720
Move!

26:46.200 --> 26:46.830
Move faster!

26:51.860 --> 26:54.940
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

26:57.790 --> 26:58.590
Your Highness,

26:58.750 --> 27:00.790
the Crown Prince
has sent another letter.

27:01.590 --> 27:02.310
Read it.

27:02.310 --> 27:03.960
"Day after day,

27:03.960 --> 27:06.440
thoughts of you linger in my heart.

27:06.550 --> 27:09.720
The mountains are green,
the sky is high, and the road is long.

27:09.830 --> 27:12.030
Yet there is no one to meet after dusk.

27:13.070 --> 27:13.480
A...

27:14.240 --> 27:15.880
A moment apart,

27:16.270 --> 27:18.270
and my spirit fades."

27:19.750 --> 27:20.550
Your Highness,

27:20.720 --> 27:22.480
you'd better read it yourself.

27:25.140 --> 27:26.860
(How can a slight unfurrowing of brows
erase the pain in my heart?)

27:27.350 --> 27:28.440
So mushy.

27:32.750 --> 27:33.440
Your Highness,

27:33.750 --> 27:35.480
Jin Shan says there's an urgent matter.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.592
He must see you in person.

27:37.830 --> 27:38.928
Did something happen to Lin?

27:38.930 --> 27:40.000
Your Highness, Young Master

27:40.010 --> 27:41.440
can't leave here without permission,

27:41.440 --> 27:43.536
so he secretly went
to Zenan District to investigate.

27:43.590 --> 27:44.550
Before leaving, he said

27:44.550 --> 27:47.152
if there's no news from him
within five days, he might be trapped.

27:47.260 --> 27:50.310
He also said you are the only person in
the entire imperial capital he trusts,

27:50.320 --> 27:51.712
and that we could ask for your help.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.200
Hurry up!

28:27.640 --> 28:28.240
Sit down.

28:28.320 --> 28:29.590
This should be more comfortable.

28:44.110 --> 28:45.680
Does the wound on your back hurt a lot?

28:48.110 --> 28:48.750
It's nothing.

28:49.510 --> 28:50.270
Just a flesh wound.

28:50.600 --> 28:51.880
It just looks scary, that's all.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.200
Come on, get up and eat!

29:02.200 --> 29:02.790
Get up!

29:04.680 --> 29:05.510
It's mine!

29:07.350 --> 29:08.160
It's mine!

29:08.160 --> 29:09.590
Leave some for me!

29:13.680 --> 29:14.590
Eat up.

29:15.750 --> 29:17.310
They capture people for slave labor

29:17.500 --> 29:18.880
and won't even give us a full meal.

29:19.960 --> 29:21.070
Those beasts.

29:23.600 --> 29:24.850
We still have to work tomorrow.

29:25.400 --> 29:26.240
Try to eat something.

29:26.310 --> 29:27.090
I have no appetite.

29:28.110 --> 29:29.680
I really didn't expect

29:29.880 --> 29:31.240
that in Shunan's territory,

29:31.480 --> 29:33.480
someone would dare
to illegally open a mine,

29:33.480 --> 29:34.480
forge weapons,

29:34.480 --> 29:35.550
and enslave prisoners.

29:35.632 --> 29:38.070
These are capital offenses
strictly forbidden by the court.

29:38.688 --> 29:41.280
Shunan's terrain is complex
and extremely difficult to control.

29:42.128 --> 29:43.640
For them to operate in such a place

29:44.240 --> 29:45.480
on such a massive scale,

29:45.664 --> 29:47.696
the forces behind them
must be formidable.

29:50.080 --> 29:52.180
Right now, conserving our strength
is what matters.

29:52.550 --> 29:53.550
You should eat something.

29:55.030 --> 29:56.160
I really have no appetite.

30:01.510 --> 30:02.310
You're injured.

30:03.120 --> 30:05.510
I practice martial arts year-round,
so I get injured often.

30:05.510 --> 30:07.568
I wouldn't have noticed
if you hadn't mentioned it.

30:11.210 --> 30:12.720
Don't make a big deal out of it, okay?

30:15.030 --> 30:16.200
In front of me,

30:16.920 --> 30:19.070
you don't have to be
the flawless Young Master Bu.

30:23.200 --> 30:23.640
Here.

30:32.030 --> 30:33.240
Everyone knows

30:33.440 --> 30:35.200
that I, Bu Shulin, am a playboy.

30:35.250 --> 30:37.440
I spend my time drinking, partying
and fooling around.

30:37.440 --> 30:38.656
I'm ignorant and incompetent.

30:42.070 --> 30:43.400
Take a good look for yourself.

30:46.600 --> 30:47.790
You, ignorant and incompetent?

30:50.820 --> 30:53.500
You were summoned to the capital
by imperial decree at age nine.

30:53.510 --> 30:55.070
You were essentially a hostage.

30:55.590 --> 30:56.640
Your every move

30:57.070 --> 30:59.160
influenced the court's judgment
of Shunan.

31:01.350 --> 31:02.510
Yet, at such a young age,

31:03.440 --> 31:05.440
you navigated alone among nobles,

31:05.472 --> 31:06.640
civil and military officials,

31:06.656 --> 31:07.760
and even around His Majesty.

31:07.824 --> 31:09.830
You never brought the slightest trouble
to Shunan.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.240
I know

31:13.952 --> 31:16.000
you have your own responsibilities
to shoulder.

31:17.960 --> 31:18.880
This responsibility

31:21.510 --> 31:22.550
is both admirable

31:24.160 --> 31:25.240
and heartbreaking.

31:31.712 --> 31:33.550
If you don't want me
sitting next to you,

31:35.160 --> 31:36.270
I can move further away.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.790
Get some sleep.

31:42.000 --> 31:42.990
I'll keep watch for you.

32:27.600 --> 32:28.160
Your Highness,

32:28.192 --> 32:29.630
Bu Shulin has gone missing in Zenan.

32:29.640 --> 32:31.104
Commandery Princess followed him.

32:32.440 --> 32:33.070
I'll go, too.

32:33.590 --> 32:35.510
No. You haven't fully recovered yet.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.616
Also, we still haven't
found the mastermind

32:37.620 --> 32:39.780
behind the assassins who attacked you
at the lantern festival.

32:39.790 --> 32:40.720
I'm afraid those people

32:40.720 --> 32:41.820
will try to harm you again.

32:41.830 --> 32:43.270
I've ordered Zhao Zhenghao
to keep investigating

32:43.270 --> 32:44.880
the connection
between those assassins and Li Yanhui.

32:44.880 --> 32:46.200
Prepare the carriage. We leave now.

32:46.200 --> 32:46.640
Yes.

32:58.240 --> 32:58.680
Come here.

33:08.270 --> 33:09.880
You memorized all the routes here?

33:10.960 --> 33:12.000
The scale of this place

33:12.000 --> 33:13.510
far exceeds a normal mine.

33:13.880 --> 33:15.960
The illegal forging of weapons
is undeniable proof.

33:16.270 --> 33:17.480
We need to escape quickly

33:17.480 --> 33:18.270
and get the word out

33:18.448 --> 33:19.680
to wipe out this den of thieves.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.720
But the paths here go in all directions.

33:21.824 --> 33:23.392
I can't believe you remembered them all.

33:25.350 --> 33:26.720
My brilliance

33:26.720 --> 33:28.070
is already known to you.

33:28.272 --> 33:30.200
So there's no need for me
to hide it anymore.

33:37.880 --> 33:39.240
If we start from here,

33:40.480 --> 33:42.070
we only need to take out two guards.

33:47.880 --> 33:50.200
Avoid the main mine shaft
and armory on the west side,

33:50.510 --> 33:51.920
and leave through the east passage.

33:52.030 --> 33:53.310
This is the shortest route.

33:54.400 --> 33:56.400
Your brilliance

33:57.310 --> 33:58.640
is on par with mine.

34:00.110 --> 34:01.070
We're quite a match.

34:33.960 --> 34:34.440
Let's go.

34:34.800 --> 34:35.800
Someone's escaping!

34:35.800 --> 34:36.550
After them!

34:37.320 --> 34:37.760
Hurry!

34:38.480 --> 34:39.280
Catch them!

34:39.800 --> 34:40.320
Hurry!

34:41.760 --> 34:42.280
Hurry!

34:48.920 --> 34:49.670
There they are!

34:49.670 --> 34:50.510
Catch them!

34:51.280 --> 34:51.960
Over there!

34:52.032 --> 34:53.280
There are too many of them!

34:53.360 --> 34:54.150
You go first.

34:54.150 --> 34:55.400
No, we leave together.

34:56.960 --> 34:57.670
Listen to me.

35:00.030 --> 35:00.480
Go!

35:07.710 --> 35:08.360
Stop!

35:08.550 --> 35:09.230
Don't run!

35:10.710 --> 35:11.280
Stop!

35:11.400 --> 35:12.030
Get him!

35:13.800 --> 35:15.510
- That's for running!
- That's for running!

35:20.030 --> 35:20.760
Here you go, sir.

35:21.190 --> 35:22.110
Your horse is ready.

35:30.880 --> 35:31.760
Who are you?

35:34.960 --> 35:36.260
I am

35:36.260 --> 35:38.440
(Tang Juan, Magistrate of Zenan)
Tang Juan, Magistrate of Zenan District.

35:38.672 --> 35:39.960
Magistrate of Zenan District?

35:41.070 --> 35:41.630
Guards,

35:41.840 --> 35:43.190
arrest this fugitive.

35:43.440 --> 35:44.360
Throw him in prison

35:44.380 --> 35:45.670
and interrogate him thoroughly.

35:46.000 --> 35:46.590
Yes, sir.

35:51.780 --> 35:54.340
(Zenan District Office)

35:57.760 --> 35:58.840
The Crown Prince?

36:00.304 --> 36:02.750
His Highness must have followed
Commandery Princess here.

36:06.660 --> 36:08.550
Wherever he is,
and whatever he thinks or does

36:08.550 --> 36:09.616
have nothing to do with us.

36:09.664 --> 36:11.008
We need to focus on our business.

36:17.840 --> 36:18.670
Prefect Yu.

36:19.070 --> 36:21.550
(Yu Zao, Prefect of Zenan)
This man is Marquis of Shunan's heir.

36:22.280 --> 36:23.710
How should we deal with him?

36:24.000 --> 36:26.190
Since he already knows about the mine,

36:27.550 --> 36:29.550
we can't give him the chance

36:30.000 --> 36:31.670
to spread the word.

36:31.670 --> 36:32.480
Silence him?

36:33.840 --> 36:36.000
But he's the heir
of the Marquis of Shunan.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.800
In Marquis of Shunan's Manor,

36:38.280 --> 36:39.480
he is the heir.

36:42.550 --> 36:44.670
In the Zenan prison,

36:45.480 --> 36:47.710
he's just a death row inmate.

36:49.190 --> 36:50.150
I understand.

36:50.670 --> 36:52.360
Prefect Yu, Magistrate Tang.

36:54.000 --> 36:55.000
The daughter of Duke Wei,

36:55.024 --> 36:56.580
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
has arrived.

36:56.590 --> 36:57.904
She is already in the front hall.

36:58.320 --> 36:59.840
Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

37:01.280 --> 37:02.760
Why is she here?

37:04.590 --> 37:05.840
What are you waiting for?

37:07.000 --> 37:08.550
I'll get it done immediately.

37:34.630 --> 37:36.360
It seems someone can't wait.

37:37.000 --> 37:37.920
If you kill me,

37:38.736 --> 37:40.480
have you thought
about the consequences?

37:41.480 --> 37:43.360
You must know who I am by now.

37:43.480 --> 37:45.630
If I die in your Zenan prison,

37:47.590 --> 37:49.070
do you think you can get away with it?

37:49.710 --> 37:51.190
Do you think your superiors

37:51.190 --> 37:53.070
will step up and take the blame

37:53.670 --> 37:55.710
or will they throw you
under the bus immediately

37:56.320 --> 37:58.480
as a scapegoat
to appease the Marquis's wrath

37:58.480 --> 38:00.630
and cover up all their crimes?

38:08.360 --> 38:10.000
It's not too late to stop now.

38:28.190 --> 38:29.360
No matter what you say,

38:29.630 --> 38:30.670
this engagement

38:31.000 --> 38:32.480
must be broken.

38:32.590 --> 38:33.600
You are bullying me again.

38:36.230 --> 38:38.770
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

38:40.070 --> 38:41.550
It doesn't matter if some things

38:42.150 --> 38:42.960
take a little longer.

38:43.630 --> 38:44.630
I'm willing to wait.

38:50.470 --> 38:53.410
♪I've hidden so many words♪

38:54.030 --> 38:56.830
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

38:57.700 --> 39:04.670
♪So never uncover♪

39:04.860 --> 39:07.220
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

39:08.350 --> 39:11.080
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

39:12.040 --> 39:17.380
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

39:19.140 --> 39:21.960
♪Every answer I gave♪

39:22.760 --> 39:25.610
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

39:26.400 --> 39:29.770
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

39:30.030 --> 39:33.340
♪How hard it truly was?♪

39:36.310 --> 39:39.750
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:40.740 --> 39:43.070
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:44.340 --> 39:50.100
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

39:51.510 --> 39:54.640
♪It's a shame I never could♪

39:55.090 --> 39:58.100
♪Give you a moon in return♪

39:58.210 --> 40:04.850
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

40:04.850 --> 40:08.520
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

40:09.390 --> 40:12.150
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

40:12.590 --> 40:15.720
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

40:16.160 --> 40:22.110
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

40:23.510 --> 40:27.060
♪You'll never♪

40:27.340 --> 40:36.810
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

41:02.980 --> 41:06.460
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
